<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block email_title %}Kdos-Graphie{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 32px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; }
        .header { background-color: #1c1917; padding: 24px 32px; }
        .header-brand { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-decoration: none; }
        .body { padding: 32px; color: #1c1917; }
        .body h1 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1c1917; }
        .body p { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #44403c; }
        .body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .reference-block { background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fcd34d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .reference-block .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .reference-block .value { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #78350f; font-family: monospace; }
        .order-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
        .order-table th { background-color: #f5f5f4; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #78716c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e5e4; }
        .order-table td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f5f5f4; color: #44403c; vertical-align: top; }
        .order-table .total-row td { font-weight: 700; color: #1c1917; border-top: 2px solid #e7e5e4; border-bottom: none; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #f59e0b; color: #1c1917; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .info-block { background-color: #f5f5f4; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #57534e; }
        .info-block strong { color: #1c1917; }
        .footer { padding: 20px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #f5f5f4; font-size: 12px; color: #a8a29e; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
        <span class="header-brand">KDOS-GRAPHIE</span>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
        {% block email_body %}{% endblock %}
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        Kdos-Graphie — Créations graphiques personnalisées<br>
        Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre directement.
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
